# Line endings are not a matter of taste here.
#
# Git on Windows defaults to converting LF to CRLF on checkout. That is fine
# for prose and fatal for a shell script: `set -eu` becomes `set -eu\r`, and
# sh reports "Illegal option -". It also makes every file in the repo look
# modified, which buries real changes in thousands of phantom ones.
#
# So: normalise everything to LF in the repository, and check it out as LF.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Except things that are not text at all and must never be touched.
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.webp binary
*.bin  binary
*.zip  binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf  binary
*.otf  binary
*.bundle binary
